# Not committed: a Windows-generated lockfile does not reliably capture
# every platform-specific optional dependency (e.g. Tailwind's Oxide
# native/WASM binaries) needed by npm ci/install on Linux CI runners.
# Letting npm resolve fresh on each platform avoids that mismatch.
package-lock.json

